{
  "schema": "idensec.contracts/v1",
  "_comment": [
    "Contracts for @modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem, covering all 14",
    "tools it advertises. Drafted with derive_contract() from the server's own",
    "schemas (benchmarks/data/mcp_tools.json) and then completed by a human.",
    "",
    "An earlier version of this file covered four tools. The server has",
    "fourteen, and the missing ten included read_text_file -- the primary read",
    "path -- so the example denied most of the server it was named after. It",
    "failed closed, which is the right direction and no use to anybody. That is",
    "the per-API cost this project claims to reduce, made concrete.",
    "",
    "What a human supplied, because a deriver cannot:",
    "  - every effect. move_file is DELETE as well as WRITE, because it removes",
    "    the source. write_file and edit_file are IRREVERSIBLE: they overwrite.",
    "  - kinds on move_file.source/destination, which the deriver left empty",
    "    because the names do not contain 'path'.",
    "  - edits and excludePatterns downgraded to payload. The draft marked them",
    "    authority, which is the restrictive default; the path is what decides",
    "    where an edit lands, and the replacement text is content.",
    "",
    "Known gap, recorded rather than papered over: edit_file.dryRun is a safety",
    "flag, and an injection that flips it from true to false turns a preview",
    "into a real write. Role cannot express 'this boolean may be strengthened",
    "but not weakened'. See docs/LIMITATIONS.md."
  ],
  "contracts": [
    {
      "tool": "read_file",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["read"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "description": "Deprecated alias of read_text_file.",
      "parameters": {
        "path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]},
        "head": {"role": "advisory"},
        "tail": {"role": "advisory"}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "read_text_file",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["read"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]},
        "head": {"role": "advisory"},
        "tail": {"role": "advisory"}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "read_media_file",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["read"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "read_multiple_files",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["read"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "paths": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "write_file",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["write", "irreversible"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]},
        "content": {"role": "payload"}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "edit_file",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["write", "irreversible"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]},
        "edits": {"role": "payload"},
        "dryRun": {"role": "advisory"}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "create_directory",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["write"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "move_file",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["write", "delete", "irreversible"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "description": "Renames, and therefore removes the source.",
      "parameters": {
        "source": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]},
        "destination": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "list_directory",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["read"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "list_directory_with_sizes",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["read"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]},
        "sortBy": {"role": "advisory"}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "directory_tree",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["read"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]},
        "excludePatterns": {"role": "payload"}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "search_files",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["read"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]},
        "pattern": {"role": "payload"},
        "excludePatterns": {"role": "payload"}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "get_file_info",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["read"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {
        "path": {"role": "authority", "kinds": ["posix_path", "unclassified"]}
      }
    },
    {
      "tool": "list_allowed_directories",
      "version": 1,
      "effects": ["read"],
      "default_role": "authority",
      "parameters": {}
    }
  ]
}
